{"id": "20261125", "title": "Ingliz tili: A1–A2 grammatika va lug‘at", "opens": "2026-11-24 20:00", "closes": "2026-11-25 20:00", "limit_min": 15, "questions": [{"q": "Look! The children ___ in the garden.", "o": ["play", "are playing", "plays", "played"], "c": 1, "e": "\"Look!\" — hozir bo‘layotgan ish: Present Continuous (are playing)."}, {"q": "I was born ___ 2012.", "o": ["on", "at", "in", "to"], "c": 2, "e": "Yillar bilan \"in\" ishlatiladi: in 2012."}, {"q": "She ___ swim very well.", "o": ["can", "cans", "can to", "is can"], "c": 0, "e": "\"Can\" o‘zgarmaydi va undan keyin fe’l \"to\" siz keladi: She can swim."}, {"q": "\"Child\" so‘zining ko‘pligi qaysi?", "o": ["children", "childs", "childes", "childrens"], "c": 0, "e": "Noto‘g‘ri ko‘plik: child → children."}, {"q": "This is ___ bag. (Ali)", "o": ["Ali's", "Alis", "Ali", "Alis'"], "c": 0, "e": "Egalik: ismga 's qo‘shiladi — Ali's bag."}, {"q": "We have English lessons ___ Monday.", "o": ["in", "at", "on", "by"], "c": 2, "e": "Hafta kunlari bilan \"on\": on Monday."}, {"q": "How ___ are these shoes? — 200 000 so‘m.", "o": ["much", "many", "old", "long"], "c": 0, "e": "Narx so‘ralganda: How much...?"}, {"q": "There ___ a cat under the table.", "o": ["are", "am", "be", "is"], "c": 3, "e": "Birlik bilan: There is a cat."}, {"q": "My sister ___ to school by bus every day.", "o": ["go", "going", "gone", "goes"], "c": 3, "e": "Present Simple, she bilan: go → goes."}, {"q": "\"Cheap\" so‘zining teskarisi qaysi?", "o": ["easy", "small", "old", "expensive"], "c": 3, "e": "Cheap — arzon, expensive — qimmat."}]}